OL,3,GNEWSAHospital volunteer says it led to
OL,4,Acareer change
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital volunteer who found a new
OL,7,Fcareer in his 60s is encouraging others
OL,8,Fto give their time to the NHS, after it
OL,9,Fhelped him secure a permanent role.
OL,11,FMark Harvey began volunteering with
OL,12,FSouth Tyneside and Sunderland NHS
OL,13,FFoundation Trust in 2024, supporting
OL,14,Fthe clinical engineering team.
OL,16,FThe 62-year-old former care support
OL,17,Fworker said the experience helped him
OL,18,Fdevelop new skills, gain confidence and
OL,19,Fa better understanding of the NHS
OL,20,Fworkplace, which he drew upon in the
OL,21,Finterview when a post as medical device
OL,22,Flibrary operative came up.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
